{"run_id":"demo-po1003","seq":11,"ts":"2026-10-24T09:32:02Z","type":"answer","payload":{"text":"PO-1003 runs at the ST02_SEALING station, where the temperature is monitored by sensor model TMP-2210 supplied by ThermoSense GmbH. The operational rule RULE-ST02-01 limits the sealing temperature to 195°C, which is within the TMP-2210's 200°C continuous rating, so the order can run at this 195°C limit. However, the critical threshold rules (RULE-THR-ST02-TMP-CRIT and RULE-ST02-02) set the critical limit at 210°C, which exceeds the sensor's 200°C rating.","justification":"PO-1003 is executed at ST02_SEALING [68dff3af3f55]. The station temperature is monitored by ST02_SEALING_TMP [34b63c1cf963], which is of model TMP-2210 [76b1a8f75577]; this sensor is supplied by ThermoSense GmbH [2151832c7759]. RULE-ST02-01 applies to both ST02_SEALING_TMP [19bb6e2f0f3c] and ST02_SEALING [591055e16c79] and mandates the temperature remain between 175°C and 195°C. The TMP-2210 datasheet rates the sensor for 200°C continuous operation. RULE-THR-ST02-TMP-CRIT applies to ST02_SEALING_TMP [79e2a13dac58] and ST02_SEALING [29dcfd3b3f64] and sets CRIT_HI at 210.0°C, while RULE-ST02-02 applies to both [b23e10c11ecd, f1e78defa0d6] and marks temperatures above 210°C as critical, contradicting the sensor's 200°C rating.","citations":[{"edge_id":"68dff3af3f55","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"34b63c1cf963","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"76b1a8f75577","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"2151832c7759","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"19bb6e2f0f3c","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"591055e16c79","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"79e2a13dac58","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"29dcfd3b3f64","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"b23e10c11ecd","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"f1e78defa0d6","chunk_id":null}],"contradictions":[],"canary":null}}
